# MACHINERY. This file travels with the folder and protects it on Windows:
# bash cannot run scripts with CRLF line endings, and git's autocrlf setting
# would otherwise rewrite them on checkout. These rules pin everything here to
# LF in every repository this folder is copied into.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.Dockerfile text eol=lf
